    * parameters: ('- **Product & Packaging Strategy:** Focus on high-grade soy wax compositions paired with clean aesthetic profiles, prolonged burn times, and heavy-duty heat-resistant glass containers engineered for multi-cycle home decor upcycling.\n- **Scent Architecture & Collections:** Developing diverse scent profiles spanning warm vanilla, soothing lavender, pumpkin cinnamon, fresh linen, and sophisticated regional oud blends combined with local botanicals to prevent brand fatigue.\n- **Market Gap Exploitation & Positioning:** Targeting the unexploited Mid-to-High Artisanal pricing tier (EGP 600 - 850) to bridge basic indie alternatives and expensive imported luxury brands like Bath & Body Works.\n- **Future Growth Vectors:** Establishing B2B hospitality and boutique spa private-label programs, seasonal limited-edition collections, and curated quarterly sensory subscription box frameworks.', {'active_plans': '- **Product & Packaging Strategy:** Focus on high-grade soy wax compositions paired with clean aesthetic profiles, prolonged burn times, and heavy-duty heat-resistant glass containers engineered for multi-cycle home decor upcycling.\n- **Scent Architecture & Collections:** Developing diverse scent profiles spanning warm vanilla, soothing lavender, pumpkin cinnamon, fresh linen, and sophisticated regional oud blends combined with local botanicals to prevent brand fatigue.\n- **Market Gap Exploitation & Positioning:** Targeting the unexploited Mid-to-High Artisanal pricing tier (EGP 600 - 850) to bridge basic indie alternatives and expensive imported luxury brands like Bath & Body Works.\n- **Future Growth Vectors:** Establishing B2B hospitality and boutique spa private-label programs, seasonal limited-edition collections, and curated quarterly sensory subscription box frameworks.', 'source': 'ltm_compressor', 'created_at': '2026-10-11T20:11:09.435131+00:00', 'updated_at': '2026-10-12T10:20:40.884328+00:00'}, 'mem_plan_ba3c879d057b')
