2026-10-12 13:43:52.553 | INFO    | app.db.trace             | [req=req_1e83139d75f84831 | biz=biz_2b69ca4ecf694365a53c] | [DATABASE - UPDATE] Executing query
    * operation: UPDATE
    * statement: UPDATE brand_memory_items SET text=$1::VARCHAR, metadata=$2::JSON WHERE brand_memory_items.id = $3::VARCHAR
    * parameters: ('- **Market Positioning & Gap Strategy:** Capitalizing on the untapped Mid-to-High Artisanal Sweet Spot (EGP 600 - 850) by offering 100% pure soy wax, clean cotton wicks, and multi-cycle upcycled heat-resistant glass containers that double as home decor.\n- **Product Tiering & Pricing Model:**\n  - Standard Jar (~180-200g soy): EGP 380 - 450 (Mass everyday use & gifting)\n  - Large/Double Wick Jar (~300-350g soy): EGP 600 - 680 (Living rooms, strong scent throw, smart alternative to imported brands)\n  - Mini Jar / Travel Tin (~100g soy): EGP 200 - 250 (Discovery & low barrier to entry)\n- **Launch Advertising Strategy (Meta Platforms):**\n  - Budget Tier (Recommended): EGP 12,000 to 15,000 for the launch month.\n  - Phase 1: Teaser Phase (35% budget / 2 weeks) focused on BTS manufacturing, clean-burning soy benefits, and building a waitlist/leads.\n  - Phase 2: Launch & Conversion Phase (65% budget / 3 weeks) utilizing Carousel & Video ads highlighting upcycled glass decor utility, bundle offers, and value comparison against high-end imports.\n- **Audience Targeting:** Ages 24-45 in urban hubs (New Cairo, 5th Settlement, Sheikh Zayed, 6th of October, Maadi, Zamalek, Smouha), interested in home decor, interior design, aromatherapy, wellness, self-care, and sustainable living.\n- **Future Growth Vectors:** Expanding into B2B hospitality (boutique hotels and spas private-label programs) and quarterly sensory subscription boxes.', {'active_plans': '- **Market Positioning & Gap Strategy:** Capitalizing on the untapped Mid-to-High Artisanal Sweet Spot (EGP 600 - 850) by offering 100% pure soy wax, clean cotton wicks, and multi-cycle upcycled heat-resistant glass containers that double as home decor.\n- **Product Tiering & Pricing Model:**\n  - Standard Jar (~180-200g soy): EGP 380 - 450 (Mass everyday use & gifting)\n  - Large/Double Wick Jar (~300-350g soy): EGP 600 - 680 (Living rooms, strong scent throw, smart alternative to imported brands)\n  - Mini Jar / Travel Tin (~100g soy): EGP 200 - 250 (Discovery & low barrier to entry)\n- **Launch Advertising Strategy (Meta Platforms):**\n  - Budget Tier (Recommended): EGP 12,000 to 15,000 for the launch month.\n  - Phase 1: Teaser Phase (35% budget / 2 weeks) focused on BTS manufacturing, clean-burning soy benefits, and building a waitlist/leads.\n  - Phase 2: Launch & Conversion Phase (65% budget / 3 weeks) utilizing Carousel & Video ads highlighting upcycled glass decor utility, bundle offers, and value comparison against high-end imports.\n- **Audience Targeting:** Ages 24-45 in urban hubs (New Cairo, 5th Settlement, Sheikh Zayed, 6th of October, Maadi, Zamalek, Smouha), interested in home decor, interior design, aromatherapy, wellness, self-care, and sustainable living.\n- **Future Growth Vectors:** Expanding into B2B hospitality (boutique hotels and spas private-label programs) and quarterly sensory subscription boxes.', 'source': 'ltm_compressor', 'created_at': '2026-10-11T20:11:09.435131+00:00', 'updated_at': '2026-10-12T10:43:52.552369+00:00'}, 'mem_plan_ba3c879d057b')
