    * parameters: ('- **Market Gap Opportunities & Strategies:**\n  - **Pricing:** Targeted the untapped Mid-to-High Artisanal tier (EGP 600 - 850) as the primary sweet spot, filling the gap between cheap commercial candles (<EGP 350) and ultra-luxury/imported brands (>EGP 950).\n  - **Sustainability:** Leveraged multi-cycle upcycled heat-resistant glass containers (heavy-duty, engineered for reuse as home decor, kitchen storage, or planters) as a unique product differentiator.\n  - **Scent Architecture:** Proposed sophisticated regional and botanical-infused scent profiles (narrative scents) to avoid generic market replication.\n  - **Growth Vectors:** Highlighted B2B hospitality, boutique spa private-label programs, and quarterly sensory subscription boxes for structural growth.\n  - **Key Competitors Analyzed:** Aromatica, Pia Scents, Splendour, Candelle Egypt, and Bath & Body Works (benchmark).\n\n- **Advertising Strategy & Launch Plan (High-Scale Meta Campaign):**\n  - **Goal:** Brand awareness, massive market penetration, lead generation, and waitlist building in major Egyptian cities (Cairo, Giza, Alexandria - New Cairo, Zamalek, Zayed, October, Maadi, Smouha).\n  - **Target Audience:** Age 24-45, interested in home decor, interior design, soy candles, aromatherapy, wellness, self-care, sustainable living (excluding under-23s).\n  - **Ad Angles:** Clean-burning health (100% soy wax, cotton wicks), upcycled glass decor, and affordable luxury (EGP 600-850).\n  - **Funnel Phases & Copy:** \n    1. *Teaser Phase (Week 1):* Hype building, BTS production, waitlist/pre-launch offers with Egyptian Conversational copy focused on pure soy and calming mood lighting.\n    2. *Launch Phase (Weeks 2-3):* Conversion focus via Carousel & Video ads showing burn mood, upcycled reuse, gift-ready unboxing, and direct-to-door delivery.\n    3. *Retargeting & Scaling Phase (Week 4):* Social proof, user-generated content (UGC), and scaling winning ad sets.\n  - **Visuals:** Cinematic mood lighting, night burn videos, and ASMR pouring with calm audio on Reels.\n\n- **Budget Allocation & Proposed Investment (EGP):**\n  - **Massive Scale Launch Plan (100,000 EGP total budget):** \n    - Teaser Phase: 20,000 EGP\n    - Launch & Conversion Phase: 50,000 EGP\n    - Retargeting & Scaling Phase: 30,000 EGP\n  - **ROI Tips:** Invest in high-end cinematic visuals/Reels, precise interest targeting, rapid DM/Inbox conversational response, and unboxing experiences to drive organic UGC.\n\n- **Brand Analysis:**\n  - **Positioning:** Mid-to-High Artisanal tier (EGP 600-850), delivering "Affordable Luxury" between cheap local alternatives and overpriced imports.\n  - **USPs:** 100% natural soy wax, cotton wicks, engineered heavy upcycled heat-resistant glass containers for home decor, and bespoke narrative scent architectures.', 'conv_888b9b662f8d4bbebf5f')
